{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10102050","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10102050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1010205001:0":{"text":"Thank goodness! If you hadn't saved me, I'd already be digesting in their bellies!","source_cn":"谢天谢地，要不是你们救我，我已经进了它们的肚子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97D7E26834BD7A12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010205002:0":{"text":"Let me introduce myself... My name is Lorsan.","source_cn":"自、自我介绍一下……我叫洛桑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0937AF0A72237DD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010205003:0":{"text":"Hang on, Lorsan... are you saying they were about to eat you?","source_cn":"等等……洛桑大人，您是说，您差点被它们吃掉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B92BF7C203D06A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010205004:0":{"text":"Absolutely! They were even sharpening their knives!","source_cn":"千真万确！它们连剥皮的刀都磨好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB09DF71C4D4BBFA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010205005:0":{"text":"Gruglins are carnivores. Their diet only consists of herbivores smaller than themselves.","source_cn":"咕布林虽然是肉食性类人生物，但它们的食谱上，只有那些体...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC1CCA84A0FE0A91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010205006:0":{"text":"You clearly only fit one of their criteria, Lorsan.\nThere has to be a reason for their abnormal behavior.","source_cn":"很显然，洛桑大人您只符合其中一条。\\n事出反常，必有因。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94082E91EA7B88B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1010205007:0":{"text":"How about we show some concern for the innocent little rabbit here?\nAfter such a long journey, I haven't even had a drink...","source_cn":"思考的同时可怜可怜无辜的兔子吧。\\n一路旅行到这里，连...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F4FB5C234FE26DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010205008:0":{"text":"Hang on, look at all the grapes here! A few of these would do!","source_cn":"等等，这里有好多葡萄！看起来很适合解渴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9DD1E9243721802","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010205009:0":{"text":"HOLD IT RIGHT THERE!","source_cn":"——慢着！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CE0F9164DECC208","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1010205010:0":{"text":"Nom nom nom... They're so sweet!\nThese are amazing!","source_cn":"啊呜啊呜……真甜呐！\\n这也太好吃了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B961E650E5A618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010205011:0":{"text":"Oh...\nSomething's not right. My stomach... it hurts!","source_cn":"唔……\\n有点不对劲，肚子……突然好痛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7F2EA0CCBFB2E83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1010205012:0":{"text":"Ugh! It's bad! HELP... ME...!","source_cn":"痛痛痛！救……救……我……我……呃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D5A1E886A9B7F56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:19:1010205013:0":{"text":"Lorsan falls to the ground, clutching his stomach. Everyone quickly runs over to help him up.","source_cn":"众人赶快扶起洛桑","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEE23BB0C3296492","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1010205014:0":{"text":"Is he... still alive?!","source_cn":"……他还活着吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34A8C89C745FE1AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1010205015:0":{"text":"Uh, you tell me... Is this poor bunny gonna live?","source_cn":"呃呜，告诉我……我这只命途多舛的兔子还活着吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B7FBC077733AD0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1010205016:0":{"text":"He's in fair condition, but most likely some type of poison. Initial symptom was fainting. His complexion is presently rosy...","source_cn":"身体情况尚可，但疑似中毒。前兆症状是疼痛至晕厥，目前脸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A0573A631BE0778","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1010205016":{"text":"He's in fair condition, but most likely some type of poison. Initial symptom was fainting. His complexion is presently rosy...","source_cn":"身体情况尚可，但疑似中毒。前兆症状是疼痛至晕厥，目前脸色红润，生理指标——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A0573A631BE0778","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1010205017:0":{"text":"Such a quick reaction. Are you sure it's not fake?","source_cn":"这么快有反应，不会是装的吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB317393F6A2D286B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1010205018:0":{"text":"Unconfirmed. Could be related to your constitution. This requires further study.","source_cn":"不确定，有可能和他的体质有关，需要进一步研究。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E448324573239DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1010205019:0":{"text":"We need to investigate this more closely.\nPlease sir, could you give us a bunch as a research specimen?","source_cn":"有必要进行更细致的调查。\\n请问这位先生，能给我一串葡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73F8F931B42A9FB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1010205020:0":{"text":"Not a chance!","source_cn":"想都别想！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24BF2519DDAEA18E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1010205021:0":{"text":"Lord Franz, why don't you eat a bunch right here and prove it's okay?","source_cn":"弗朗茨老爷，要不你就在这里吃一串给我们看看，证明它没问题？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x139F7EA6A51A9B0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1010205022:0":{"text":"Ridiculous! I'm under no obligation to prove anything to you!","source_cn":"可笑，我没有义务向你们证明！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4733EA4C53D804AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1010205023:0":{"text":"Lord Franz, I swear it's just for research. Once we have the results, I'll make a special mention of you in my thesis.","source_cn":"弗朗茨先生，我保证只是进行研究。一旦出了成果，我会在论...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x370383D4E298F384","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1010205024:0":{"text":"Someone! Get these gibbering lunatics out of my sight!","source_cn":"来人！把这些胡言乱语的疯子给我赶出去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89B267C3AAB7B110","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:0:1":{"text":"Was it really poison?","source_cn":"真的是中毒吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x50FB590024E7EAAB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Was it really poison?","female":"Was it really poison?","variant_male_record_index":"58908","variant_female_record_index":"58909","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:兔耳朵青年":{"text":"Wilder Youth","source":"兔耳朵青年","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"Lorsan","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:科丝蒂":{"text":"Cassadee","source":"科丝蒂","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:弗朗茨":{"text":"Franz","source":"弗朗茨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏":{"text":"Black Screen","source":"黑屏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"Valen","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":27,"localized_text_count":26,"speaker_count":6}}